  - key: legenda
    title:
      id: Saudara kembar
      en: Twin siblings
    text:
      id: 'Orang Pulau Komodo punya legenda tentang Putri Naga. Ia melahirkan anak
        kembar: seorang bayi laki-laki bernama Gerong, dan seekor bayi komodo bernama
        Orah. Keduanya dibesarkan terpisah. Suatu hari Gerong yang sudah dewasa hampir
        menombak seekor komodo di hutan. Putri Naga muncul dan berkata, komodo itu
        saudara kembarmu. Karena itu orang Komodo menyebut komodo sebae, artinya
        kembar, dan menjaganya turun-temurun.'
      en: 'The people of Komodo Island tell a legend about Princess Naga. She gave
        birth to twins: a baby boy named Gerong and a baby dragon named Orah. The
        two were raised apart. One day Gerong, now a grown man, was about to spear
        a dragon in the forest. Princess Naga appeared and said: that dragon is your
        twin. That is why the Komodo people call the dragons sebae, meaning twins,
        and have protected them for generations.'
    stage: 0
    focusHotspot: telur
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8326537c0701c304e8f66d45ea37a681, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a71dab45929b5034e8b1754375751a17, type: 3}
    cuesID:
